      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_side01_0080_brother_06",
      "hash64": "91D441A7ABA8E586",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]...I think [VAR 0x0100(0000)] and I should\\ngo\\r\\nlook\\r\\noutside.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
